{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"En plein feu (The Blaze)","Un feu géant ravage la forêt des Landes. A la suite d’une alerte évacuation, Simon et son père Joseph quittent leur domicile mais se retrouvent rapidement prisonniers de leur véhicule au milieu de ce cauchemar climatique. Le brasier se rapproche. Que faire ? Attendre les secours… ? Ou n’est-ce pas en s'enfonçant plus loin encore dans l'immensité terrifiante de la forêt brûlante qu'ils trouveront le moyen de s'en sortir… ?",[4,5,6],"fatherhood","rural","independent home",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":14,"filmType":18,"directors":19,"genre":28,"media":31,"synopsis":34,"production":36,"characters":42,"roles":57,"awards":74,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_056","fr2023-056-en-plein-feu",{"native":12,"english":13},"En plein feu","The Blaze",{"type":15,"date":16,"year":17},"Theatrical release","2023-03-08",2023,"Fiction film",[20],{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":24,"gender":25,"nationality":26,"awards":27},"Quentin Reynaud","quentin-reynaud",1982,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[29,30],"Drama","Action",{"posterUrl":32,"trailerUrl":33},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/174/246/259758/format_page/en-plein-feu.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c30QLAluEmM",{"native":2,"english":35},"",[37,39],{"country":26,"share":38},"Majority coproducer",{"country":40,"share":41},"Belgium","Minority coproducer",[43],{"id":44,"film":9,"person":45,"age":50,"gender":25,"sexuality":51,"origin":52,"class":53,"profession":54,"ability":55,"assistedMobility":56},"FR2023_056_01",{"id":46,"slug":47,"name":46,"birthYear":48,"deathYear":24,"gender":25,"nationality":26,"awards":49},"André Dussollier","andre-dussollier",1946,[],"3: Third Age (60-75)","Heterosexual","White Western European","Middle class","Retired","Able-bodied","No",[58,62,70],{"person":59,"role":61},{"id":46,"slug":47,"name":46,"birthYear":48,"deathYear":24,"gender":25,"nati